WEBVTT

00:10:28.101 --> 00:10:30.159
Želite da stavite pile u rernu

00:10:30.159 --> 00:10:32.487
i da rerna kaže: "Aha, to je pile,"

00:10:32.487 --> 00:10:33.636
i ispeče pile.

00:10:33.636 --> 00:10:35.402
"Aha, pile je za Nikolasa,

00:10:35.402 --> 00:10:37.236
a on ga voli ovako ili onako pečeno."

00:10:37.236 --> 00:10:40.289
Tako da smo inteligenciju,
umesto da bude u uređaju,

00:10:40.289 --> 00:10:41.998
danas počeli

00:10:41.998 --> 00:10:44.110
da vraćamo u mobilne telefone

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:46.480
ili bliže korisniku,

00:10:46.480 --> 00:10:48.668
ne baš prosvetljen pogled

00:10:48.668 --> 00:10:51.409
"Interneta stvari".

00:10:51.409 --> 00:10:54.873
Televizija koju sam pomenuo danas,

00:10:54.873 --> 00:10:57.495
kakva je bila 1990.

00:10:57.495 --> 00:10:58.965
i televizija sutrašnjice

00:10:58.965 --> 00:11:01.288
bi izgledala otprilike ovako.